{"title":"Career Roadmap · Bioprocess Technician","role":"Bioprocess Technician","summary":"A Bioprocess Technician supports the production of biological products by operating, monitoring, sampling, and maintaining bioprocessing systems used in biotechnology and biopharmaceutical manufacturing.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Biotechnology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Bioprocess Technician supports the production of biological products by operating, monitoring, sampling, and maintaining bioprocessing systems used in biotechnology and biopharmaceutical manufacturing."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell culture operations"},{"text":"Media preparation"},{"text":"Bioreactor operation"},{"text":"Upstream processing"},{"text":"Downstream processing"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Process monitoring"},{"text":"Equipment cleaning and sanitization"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Batch-record maintenance"},{"text":"Process troubleshooting"},{"text":"GMP compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Biotechnology student, the strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biotechnology","Bioprocess Training + GMP","Bioprocess Technician","Bioprocess Associate","Senior Bioprocess Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced process-development and scientific roles, M.Sc Biotechnology, Bioprocess Engineering, Industrial Biotechnology, Microbiology, or Biochemistry can provide additional opportunities."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc Biotechnology, cell biology, microbiology, biochemistry, bioprocess fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Bioprocess Technician / Manufacturing Associate / Production Technician"}],[{"text":"203