":"Process Analytical Technology (PAT)"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Automated bioreactors"},{"text":"AI-based process optimization"},{"text":"Predictive process control"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Real-time process monitoring"},{"text":"Advanced cell and gene therapy manufacturing"},{"text":"Automated chromatography"},{"text":"Machine-learning-based anomaly detection"},{"text":"Digital batch records"},{"text":"Bioprocess data platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future technician should evolve from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Operate the bioprocess equipment.\""},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Operate, monitor, interpret and optimize a digitally connected bioprocess.\""}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BIOTECHNOLOGY"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌────────────┴────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Cell Biology Microbiology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"└────────────┬────────────┘"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Bioprocessing"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌────────────┴────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Upstream Downstream"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Cell Culture / Filtration /"},{"type":"p","text":"Fermentation Chromatography"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │"},{"type":"p","text":"└────────────┬────────────┘"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Bioreactors"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"GMP + Aseptic"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Process Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Automation + AI"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong cell biology"},{"